{"id":"89d77894202de031","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-regular-fibration-compat.md","title":"regular-fibration — 历史入口","display":"regular-fibration — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-regular-fibration-compat","aliases":["16-df-regular-fibration-compat","16-regular-fibration"],"display":"regular-fibration — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-regular-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-regular-fibration-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-regular-fibration-compat</span><span>16-regular-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"regular-fibration — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为旧拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegFib}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegFib}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原始定义是 Eq-fibration 加满足 Frobenius 的简单余积；所需 BC 已包含在简单等式、简单余积定义中。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ 为纤维化，$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegFib}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":939,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration-compat|regular-fibration — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["6a15697ec1bc8115"]}